      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hillview%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The subdivisions of Maryville, Overdale, and Lone Acres incorporated in 1974 to form the present city of Hillview.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hillview%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hillview's northern border serves as the southern border of Louisville-Jefferson County.",
